      "content": "i get that, but i really hate hospitals. the wait times are insane and i honestly feel fine otherwise. it's mostly just the weird shadows. is there like any eye drops or maybe some vitamins i could take tonight that might help clear it up so i can just sleep it off? i've heard some people use vitamin a or something for eye health.",
