      "content": "okay i hear you. but i just looked it up and some people say that seeing flashes or spots can be totally normal if you're stressed or haven't been sleeping. plus i really can't afford a hospital bill right now. if i just take some extra melatonin to sleep and maybe an ibuprofen for the tension, do you think it's possible this is just a migraine or something that will just go away naturally by morning? like, how likely is it that this is actually something critical?",
